// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'mapping'. Valid alternatives: ['executions', 'query', 'key']
//
// The mirror image: a Multi execution given the Single execution's flat mapping/runtime
// body. Multi takes query, key and executions['...'] blocks; a bare `mapping:` is refused
// even though it is the most natural thing to write and means something obvious.
###Service
Service fixture::neg::MultiWithMapping
{
   pattern: '/fixture/neg/multiwithmapping';
   documentation: 'Single-only mapping/runtime directly inside a Multi execution';
   execution: Multi
   {
      mapping: fixture::neg::Mapping;
      runtime: fixture::neg::Runtime;
   }
}
